      "patient_response": "Unusually high or energetic? No, I don't think so. I mean, I'm always pretty energetic, but not like... not like a crazy amount for days on end. I just have my regular energy, which sometimes feels like too much for other people, I guess. \n\nLike my boss, Mr. Thompson. He's always telling me to slow down and take a breath. He's this older guy, must be in his seventies, and he moves at a snail's pace. I don't know how he ever gets anything done. And he has this weird habit of chewing on the ends of his pens. Every single pen at the front counter has these little teeth marks on them. It drives me crazy! I tried bringing in my own pens, those nice gel ones? But they smear if you write on the dry cleaning tags, so that didn't work out. I ended up giving them to my niece for her birthday. She loves drawing, especially horses. She drew this one picture of a horse jumping over a fence, and it was so good we actually framed it and put it in the hallway. But anyway... no, I haven't ever had days where I felt unusually high or anything like that. Just my normal, scattered self.",
